      "x": 20,
      "y": -130,
      "params": {
        "text": "Colonist training (spec/systems/training.md). Three routes to expertise, here as a Switch on method: 0=NATIVE LEARNING (live in a village): a free colonist/indentured servant becomes a master of the local skill (@LEARNDONE); a petty criminal is too unskilled (@LEARNSLOW); an already-skilled colonist is refused (@LEARNMASTER). 1=SCHOOL: a master teaches an unskilled colonist over 4/6/8 turns by skill tier (Schoolhouse/College/University). 2=VETERAN: a combat winner is promoted (Washington auto-promotes; else random_int(1,S) <= winner strength). PromoteUnit applies the class change."
      }
